"\n"
"<p>You should check both locations to determine where the files are located.</p>"
"\n"
"<p><b>User AppData</b> (<a href=\"copyuser\">Copy</a>):<br/>"
"\n"
"%1</p>"
"\n"
"<p><b>Private app location</b> (<a href=\"copyprivate\">Copy</a>):<br/>"
"\n"
"%2</p>"
