#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_17)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: libs/ui/forms/wdggeneralsettings.ui:1448
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In some Krita versions before 5.0 text size could be dependent on the current display DPI (which was a bug).\n"
"In Krita 5.0 this bug has been fixed, which may cause files created in previous versions look different. \n"
"\n"
"When loading old files Krita will try to adjust font size to the DPI of the current screen.\n"
"If the file has been created on a different display, try adjusting this value manually.\n"
"\n"
"After saving the file in Krita 5.0 at least once, no conversions will be needed anymore."
msgstr ""
"Nalgunhas versións de Krita anteriores á 5.0, o tamaño de texto podía depender dos DPI da pantalla (por un fallo).\n"
"En Krita 5.0 o fallo corrixiuse, polo que os ficheiros de versións anteriores poden ter un aspecto distinto.\n"
"\n"
"Ao cargar ficheiros vellos, Krita intentará axustar o tamaño da fonte ao DPI da pantalla actual.\n"
"Se o ficheiro se creou cunha pantalla distinta, probe a axustar o valor manualmente.\n"
"\n"
"Tras gardar o ficheiro en Krita 5.0 polo menos unha vez, deixará de ser necesaria ningunha conversión."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_17)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: libs/ui/forms/wdggeneralsettings.ui:1451
#: plugins/python/comics_project_management_tools/comics_export_dialog.py:66
#: plugins/python/comics_project_management_tools/comics_template_dialog.py:177
#, kde-format
msgid "DPI:"
msgstr "PPP:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, intForcedFontDPI)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: libs/ui/forms/wdggeneralsettings.ui:1460
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In some versions of Krita before 4.4.3 text size could be dependent on the current display DPI (which was a bug).\n"
"In Krita 4.4.3 this bug has been fixed, which may cause files created in previous versions look different.\n"
"To restore the old behavior you can force Krita to use Display DPI for fonts by entering it in this field."
msgstr ""
"Nalgunhas versións de Krita anteriores á 4.4.3, o tamaño do texto podería depender dos DPI da pantalla actual (por un fallo).\n"
"En Krita 4.4.3 o fallo solucionouse, polo que os ficheiros creados con versións previas poderían ter un aspecto distinto.\n"
"Para restaurar o comportamento anterior, insira os DPI da pantalla neste campo para forzar a Krita a usalos para as fontes."

