"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>To convert the current image to 12 bit accurately it will need to be converted. Rec 2100 PQ or Rec 2100 HLG is expected for HDR images.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Para converter a imaxe actual a 12 bits con precisión hai que convertela. Espéranse Rec 2100 PQ ou Rec 2100 HLG para imaxes HDR.</p>"
"</body></html>"

